{"page":66,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:122","surah":3,"ayah":122,"ar_uthmani":"إِذْ هَمَّت طَّآئِفَتَانِ مِنكُمْ أَن تَفْشَلَا وَٱللَّهُ وَلِيُّهُمَا ۗ وَعَلَى ٱللَّهِ فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Remember when two groups of you were about to lose heart and God protected them- let the believers put their trust in God-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"When","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"3:122"},{"pos":2,"ar":"هَمَّت","en_gloss":"inclined","transliteration":"hammat","verse_key":"3:122"},{"pos":3,"ar":"طَّآئِفَتَانِ","en_gloss":"two parties","transliteration":"ṭāifatāni","verse_key":"3:122"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"3:122"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"3:122"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَفْشَلَا","en_gloss":"they lost heart","transliteration":"tafshalā","verse_key":"3:122"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"but Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"3:122"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلِيُّهُمَا ۗ","en_gloss":"(was) their protector","transliteration":"waliyyuhumā","verse_key":"3:122"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَعَلَى","en_gloss":"And on","transliteration":"waʿalā","verse_key":"3:122"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:122"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ","en_gloss":"let put (their) trust","transliteration":"falyatawakkali","verse_key":"3:122"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minūna","verse_key":"3:122"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٢٢","en_gloss":"(122)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:122"}]},{"verse_key":"3:123","surah":3,"ayah":123,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ نَصَرَكُمُ ٱللَّهُ بِبَدْرٍ وَأَنتُمْ أَذِلَّةٌ ۖ فَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ لَعَلَّكُمْ تَشْكُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God helped you at Badr when you were very weak. Be mindful of God, so that you may be grateful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","tra